Subject: [PATCH net-next 16/21] net: stmmac: rk: introduce flags indicating
 support for RGMII/RMII
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Disposition: inline
Message-Id: <E1vjEv5-00000005gh7-2F9C@rmk-PC.armlinux.org.uk>
